{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲清楚地串起了“相伴的充盈暂时带来安定—满足生出延续愿望—眼前的亲近已不足以承托这一愿望—继续加力也无法补足—用力退下后身体松动而牵挂仍在”的因果链，但对共同感受为何突然变成孤身感、时间感为何松开，以及幸福真实与未来无法保证之间的区别，解释得较为概括。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙不仅解释了饱满感退去为何使悬而未决的问题浮现，还分别说明了共同感受中断如何带来孤单与时间距离、为何真实的幸福不能保证对方心意或未来，以及放下紧抓如何反过来让身体松动，但“相处已持续得足够久”等时间性推断略显预设，部分因果仍依赖未在文本中充分展开的前提。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙保留了甲的核心因果链，并更具体地解释了此刻的转折、身体状态与心理感受的相互作用，以及幸福退潮后疑问如何浮现，同时没有把不确定性误写成幸福虚假或关系破裂；额外推断虽有些偏满，但不足以构成实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2878d54b-fe54-4a99-9fb2-dd4d1011991f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133036810999Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.312, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:31:31.126551+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "077c4296f3e57d421fb0c823c49b70268e4cfe2ffdfcbc3e2c6ecbc1842cf465", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3